flowchart TD
    Q[User query] --> P[Planner]
    P --> R[Retriever agent]
    R --> T[RAG tool]
    T --> H[Hybrid retrieval: FAISS + BM25-style]
    H --> C[Consultation specialist / diagnosis boundary]
    C --> V[Grounding validator]
    V -->|unsupported, retry once with larger k| R
    V -->|validated| O[Answer + sources + context + trace]
    O --> API[FastAPI /query]
    API --> UI[Streamlit chat]
    UI --> F[Feedback endpoint]
    F --> L[Feedback JSONL for offline review]
